text I wake up disoriented.
text Seems like I was having a dream.
text Was it really just a dream...?
text The details are fuzzy.
text Something was burning.
text I tried to put out the fire.
text No matter how hard I tried, I couldn't put it out.
text That's the kind of dream it was.
text With my mind still jumbled up, I try to clear my head of the lingering traces of the dream.
text My eyes focus on my surroundings.
text The usual room. The usual ceiling.
text I try to think through the haze clouding my blood-deprived brain.
text My name is Tomoya Okazaki. Today is May 4th and I'm meeting up with Kotomi at 10:00 am.
text I glance at the clock by my bed.
