music BGM08D.mp3
text We arrive at the usual place without talking much.
text It's almost nighttime.
text The light has faded and the darkness grows moment by moment.
text Her mature black dress seems to blend into the background.
text We stand there together, neither able to speak nor part ways.
text As the bustle of the town fades, it's replaced with an empty silence conveyed by the distant autumn.
text @[Tomoya]
text Uhh...
text @[Tomoya]
text Did you have fun today?
setvar strS[1001] = "CGKT16C"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGKT16C.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound DJA.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text It was very, very fun.
text A bright smile pierces the twilight.
sound DJB.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text But...
text @[Tomoya]
text But?
sound DJC.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text No, it's nothing...
text @[Tomoya]
text All right.
setvar strS[1001] = "NONE"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
text We go silent again. The conversation doesn't lead anywhere.
text I'm sure we're both tired due to having so much fun.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGKT31C"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGKT31C.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
text Using my peripheral vision, I steal a glance at Kotomi.
text She looks cold because of the exposed skin near her shoulders.
text @[Tomoya]
text Hey...
setvar strS[1001] = "CGKT30C"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGKT30C.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound DJD.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text Um...
text We speak at almost the same moment.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGKT31C"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGKT31C.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound DJE.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text Um... go ahead, Tomoya-kun.
text @[Tomoya]
text Okay...
text @[Tomoya]
text If you'd like...
text It's embarrassing, so I make it quick.
text @[Tomoya]
text Do you want to go somewhere tomorrow? Just the two of us, for real this time.
setvar strS[1001] = "NONE"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
text As usual, Kotomi tilts her head to the side, looking slightly confused.
text Then she turns to me again.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGKT13C"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGKT13C.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound DJF.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text I was just about to ask the same thing.
text @[Tomoya]
text Then tomorrow... the same time and place as today?
sound DJG.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text Yes. 10:00 am, right here.
text @[Tomoya]
text Oh, and "right here" means "anywhere around this intersection." Wherever it's most comfortable.
sound DJH.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text ?
text @[Tomoya]
text Well, I just have to make sure I'm not late.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGKT16C"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGKT16C.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound DJI.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text Um... to tell you the truth...
sound DJJ.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text I was really, really worried this morning.
sound DJK.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text I thought that if I was even a little off from this location, you wouldn't come...
text I remember that I was forty minutes late.
text I'm not Kyou, but making a woman wait is definitely the worst.
text @[Tomoya]
text Thank you for waiting for me.
text I place my right hand on Kotomi's head.
text @[Tomoya]
text I'll make sure I'm not late tomorrow, so don't worry.
text I brush her hair with my hand.
sound DJL.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text Yes.
sound DJM.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text I'll be waiting.
text After a second's hesitation, she gives a relieved smile.
sound DJN.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text I'll be waiting...
text She repeats it quietly.
text A wind blows down the street as if bringing new darkness to us.
text It's the signal for us to part ways.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGKT13C"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGKT13C.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound DJO.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text Tomoya-kun, see you tomorrow.
text @[Tomoya]
text Yeah. See you tomorrow.
setvar strS[1001] = "NONE"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
text I watch the familiar sight as she walks off alone.
text She's slouching slightly, but she's walking surprisingly fast...
text Silver stars are already shining in the western sky.
text @[Tomoya]
text The first stars of the evening, huh?
text Kotomi probably won't notice them all the way home.
text I don't know why I'm thinking about this.
